WEBVTT

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:26.210
ashita he tsuzuku sakamichi no tochuu de

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:26.210
On the uphill road that leads to tomorrow

00:00:28.550 --> 00:00:32.510
surechigau otona tachi wa tsubuyaku no sa

00:00:28.550 --> 00:00:32.510
We pass by adults who tell us this

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:37.640
"ai toka yume toka risou mo wakaru kedo

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:37.640
"I can understand ideals such as love and dreams

00:00:39.850 --> 00:00:43.810
me no mae no genjitsu wa sonna ni amaku nai" tte

00:00:39.850 --> 00:00:43.810
but the real world isn't as easy as you think"

00:00:44.940 --> 00:00:50.150
tsumazuki nagara mo korogari nagara mo

00:00:44.940 --> 00:00:50.150
Even though we keep tripping and falling

00:00:50.940 --> 00:00:55.360
kasabuta darake no jyounetsu wo wasuretaku nai

00:00:50.940 --> 00:00:55.360
We have to remember these pains of growing up

00:00:56.320 --> 00:00:58.830
otona ni narenai bokura no

00:00:56.320 --> 00:00:58.830
For all of us who can't force ourselves to do so yet

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.330
tsuyogari wo hitotsu kiite kure

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.330
Listen to this one thing I have to say

00:01:02.250 --> 00:01:04.540
nige mo kakure mo shinai kara

00:01:02.250 --> 00:01:04.540
I won't run or cower away

00:01:04.620 --> 00:01:07.460
waraitai yatsu dake warae

00:01:04.620 --> 00:01:07.460
So whoever wants to laugh at me, go ahead

00:01:07.710 --> 00:01:10.250
semete tayori nai bokura no

00:01:07.710 --> 00:01:10.250
Since we can't be relied upon yet

00:01:10.460 --> 00:01:12.800
jiyuu no me wo tsumitoranai de

00:01:10.460 --> 00:01:12.800
Don't take away our seed of freedom

00:01:13.420 --> 00:01:15.800
mizu wo ageru sono yakume wo

00:01:13.420 --> 00:01:15.800
The task of nurturing this plant

00:01:15.880 --> 00:01:18.890
hataseba iindarou?

00:01:15.880 --> 00:01:18.890
That's all we have to do, right?

00:01:29.980 --> 00:01:30.020
{Intro}

00:01:37.820 --> 00:01:40.490
Mochinoki Municipal General Hospital

00:01:40.950 --> 00:01:42.120
Here it is!

00:01:44.250 --> 00:01:46.920
I'm glad I can come visit
you, Takamine-kun!

00:01:47.750 --> 00:01:50.290
I got you a special present, too!

00:01:50.590 --> 00:01:53.510
He should be better in three days.

00:01:54.800 --> 00:01:56.760
He'll be okay after that?

00:01:57.090 --> 00:02:01.470
Yeah. Other than his injuries, he's fine.

00:02:02.310 --> 00:02:06.770
By the way, is Kiyomaro-kun
aiming to become a doctor?

00:02:07.020 --> 00:02:08.100
Huh?

00:02:08.100 --> 00:02:13.530
Well, it's just that it doesn't seem
like an amateur treated his injuries.

00:02:13.900 --> 00:02:17.280
Oh! I read about it before in a book.

00:02:17.650 --> 00:02:20.200
Oh, okay. I was just curious.

00:02:21.910 --> 00:02:24.450
But really, thank you. 
This is quite a relief!

00:02:24.450 --> 00:02:25.790
That's good!

00:02:26.450 --> 00:02:27.660
Well, then...

00:02:29.960 --> 00:02:31.040
What is it?

00:02:31.040 --> 00:02:33.460
Are you going to eat that?

00:02:37.010 --> 00:02:38.590
If you want it, you can have it.

00:02:39.220 --> 00:02:40.430
Really?

00:02:40.430 --> 00:02:41.550
Yeah...

00:02:41.550 --> 00:02:44.060
Yuuta! You're a good guy!

00:02:44.890 --> 00:02:46.640
I'll never forget this!

00:02:46.640 --> 00:02:48.730
W-What are you doing?

00:02:48.730 --> 00:02:49.770
Get off me!

00:02:49.770 --> 00:02:49.810
{Part A}

00:02:53.770 --> 00:02:58.240
The Lost Red Spell Book

00:02:58.240 --> 00:03:00.740
General Recepcionist

00:02:59.240 --> 00:03:01.700
Umm... excuse me!

00:03:00.740 --> 00:03:00.860
General Recepcionist

00:03:00.860 --> 00:03:00.950
General Recepcionist

00:03:00.950 --> 00:03:01.110
General Recepcionist

00:03:02.950 --> 00:03:06.580
Where is patient Takamine
Kiyomaro-kun's room?

00:03:11.370 --> 00:03:14.000
This is the third time, isn't it?

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:15.460
Shall I show you the...?

00:03:15.800 --> 00:03:16.800
Please...

00:03:17.760 --> 00:03:20.220
Well then, Kiyomaro, I'll be back, okay?

00:03:20.470 --> 00:03:21.720
Okay!

00:03:28.180 --> 00:03:29.430
Gash?

00:03:30.810 --> 00:03:32.350
Gash? Are you in there?

00:03:33.730 --> 00:03:35.730
What are you doing in there?

00:03:40.320 --> 00:03:42.110
Yuuta's food!

00:03:42.360 --> 00:03:44.950
Don't eat a hospital patient's food!

00:03:45.490 --> 00:03:48.500
But Yuuta said I could have it!

00:03:48.910 --> 00:03:53.170
Yuuta! You didn't eat this
morning either, did you?

00:03:53.500 --> 00:03:55.000
It's nasty, so I'm not eating it.

00:03:55.880 --> 00:04:00.340
And, my mom made me some
food earlier. I ate that.

00:04:02.300 --> 00:04:03.590
You...

00:04:03.590 --> 00:04:07.890
If you do that, your leg will never heal!

00:04:10.640 --> 00:04:12.100
Shut up!

00:04:12.310 --> 00:04:16.980
If the doctor was more skilled,
I would've gotten better a long time ago!

00:04:18.650 --> 00:04:24.410
I heard the operation was successful.
So, it's not the doctor's fault.

00:04:25.570 --> 00:04:28.740
It's your lack of effort!

00:04:29.080 --> 00:04:31.660
Ah, shut up! Shut up!

00:04:32.160 --> 00:04:33.250
Hey!

00:04:33.250 --> 00:04:37.130
The old guy lecturing me next door is annoying,
so I'm going somewhere else!

00:04:37.130 --> 00:04:39.590
Geez... I guess I disappointed the little brat.

00:04:42.720 --> 00:04:44.720
I told you not to eat that!

00:04:48.100 --> 00:04:49.680
That jerk, Kiyomaro...

00:04:51.850 --> 00:04:54.270
I'll be better in a week!

00:04:54.270 --> 00:04:55.440
That's great!

00:04:55.440 --> 00:04:56.690
Congratulations!

00:04:57.860 --> 00:04:59.940
This is from the whole class!

00:04:59.940 --> 00:05:01.110
Thank you!

00:05:01.110 --> 00:05:04.070
Get well soon, and we'll go play
soccer together, okay?

00:05:05.070 --> 00:05:09.950
If you do that, your leg will never heal.

00:05:15.330 --> 00:05:16.330
Damn...

00:05:17.250 --> 00:05:18.590
To Yuuta-kun
Get better soon

00:05:18.250 --> 00:05:19.460
Damn it!

00:05:19.460 --> 00:05:22.920
Did everyone only act like
this at the beginning?!

00:05:39.520 --> 00:05:42.730
Hospitals are really boring!

00:05:42.730 --> 00:05:45.990
And there's nothing new I can
read out of the red book...

00:05:46.150 --> 00:05:48.410
Hey! That's my juice!

00:05:47.950 --> 00:05:51.700
But you said you would let me have a sip, didn't you?

00:05:50.700 --> 00:05:55.580
Yeah... I wonder what it takes
to be able to read more spells.

00:05:56.660 --> 00:06:00.880
Those two hardly said anything
about the book's secrets.

00:06:03.050 --> 00:06:04.550
Why are there books?

00:06:06.170 --> 00:06:07.720
Who made them?

00:06:08.510 --> 00:06:11.930
Why do we humans have to
raise those monsters?

00:06:14.140 --> 00:06:18.940
And the spells... how
many of them are there?

00:06:19.810 --> 00:06:21.560
What kind of spells are there?

00:06:25.070 --> 00:06:29.450
What if there are spells that
absolutely must not be used?

00:06:30.280 --> 00:06:35.160
Those books are a bigger mystery
than even Gash and the others.

00:06:38.330 --> 00:06:40.580
Damn. Where did that kid go?

00:06:48.590 --> 00:06:49.930
It's gone...

00:06:52.010 --> 00:06:56.520
Akiyama Yuuta

00:06:52.970 --> 00:06:55.850
Finally! Found it!

00:06:57.140 --> 00:06:59.940
Takamine-kun, I hope
you're happy to see me!

00:07:02.520 --> 00:07:05.780
Takamine-kun! I came to visit you!

00:07:06.480 --> 00:07:09.280
Gash! Where did it
go? Do you remember?

00:07:09.400 --> 00:07:12.950
No. The last time I saw it,
it was on top of the bed.

00:07:13.660 --> 00:07:16.290
Why did the red book disappear?

00:07:16.290 --> 00:07:19.250
I went to drink some juice... but
that was only for a few minutes!

00:07:19.250 --> 00:07:22.210
There's no way the nurses would play
with a patient's personal belongings.

00:07:21.790 --> 00:07:22.750
I came to visit you!

00:07:22.210 --> 00:07:24.000
The sheets haven't been changed.

00:07:23.580 --> 00:07:24.710
You look well!

00:07:27.420 --> 00:07:30.430
Mister Yamamoto, you haven't
seen a red book, have you?

00:07:30.800 --> 00:07:31.880
Takamine-kun!

00:07:34.680 --> 00:07:36.100
You didn't notice me?!

00:07:38.140 --> 00:07:40.560
No, Suzume! You must not lose!

00:07:41.270 --> 00:07:43.690
If I show him this, he'll definitely...

00:07:43.690 --> 00:07:46.070
Takamine-kun, I brought
you some presents!

00:07:46.690 --> 00:07:49.530
I made them myself!

00:07:50.240 --> 00:07:52.700
Nakimushimika-chan! Eat her first!

00:07:50.240 --> 00:07:52.700
Nakimushimika-chan is basically
a pun meaning "Crybaby orange."

00:07:52.820 --> 00:07:56.330
When your injuries get a little better,
please eat Hohoemiyuu-chan!

00:07:56.330 --> 00:08:00.040
Finally, when you've completely recovered,
you can eat Kangekinac-chan!

00:07:56.330 --> 00:08:00.040
Kangekinac-chan is like the
"Happily-healed summer orange."

00:08:02.500 --> 00:08:04.290
I bet you're looking forward to it, right?

00:08:05.460 --> 00:08:07.840
Kiyomaro! It's not under the bed either!

00:08:20.850 --> 00:08:22.810
This is bad! Really bad, Gash!

00:08:25.190 --> 00:08:28.440
What if it accidentally got
brought to the incinerator?

00:08:28.440 --> 00:08:31.240
You'll disappear! You'll
be lost somewhere!

00:08:36.870 --> 00:08:38.490
It's because Kiyomaro is bad.

00:08:38.950 --> 00:08:39.950
What?

00:08:41.120 --> 00:08:43.370
Because you made fun of me,

00:08:43.750 --> 00:08:45.830
I decided to punish you like this.

00:08:46.170 --> 00:08:48.250
Yuuta! It was you?!

00:08:50.840 --> 00:08:52.840
Why are you punishing me?!

00:08:53.260 --> 00:08:55.050
Don't you remember?!

00:08:55.550 --> 00:08:58.300
You said my leg would never get better!

00:08:59.140 --> 00:09:01.350
You... just because of that?

00:09:01.350 --> 00:09:04.810
If you apologize, I can
tell you where it's hidden.

00:09:05.390 --> 00:09:08.360
You bastard! Why do I have to apologize?!

00:09:09.230 --> 00:09:12.650
People who don't eat their
food won't get better!

00:09:12.990 --> 00:09:16.450
If you do that, you'll spend your
whole life in the hospital!

00:09:18.070 --> 00:09:20.490
So if you understand,
return the book quickly!

00:09:22.080 --> 00:09:23.330
I'm getting angry...

00:09:23.870 --> 00:09:28.290
I thought that if you apologized obediently,
I would return the book, but...

00:09:31.340 --> 00:09:33.550
Now, I'm going to burn that book!

00:09:34.010 --> 00:09:35.720
What?!

00:09:36.880 --> 00:09:38.050
W-Wait!

00:09:40.560 --> 00:09:43.270
Ahh! That's no good, Kiyomaro-kun!

00:09:43.600 --> 00:09:47.480
If you're not careful,
your injuries will reopen!

00:09:49.360 --> 00:09:50.400
Gash!

00:09:55.490 --> 00:09:59.740
Bad, Gash-chan! Since yesterday, you've
been rampaging through the hospital!

00:10:00.870 --> 00:10:04.000
Today, I'm going to take care
of you for the entire day!

00:10:04.500 --> 00:10:06.830
I won't let you act at your own discretion.

00:10:07.500 --> 00:10:08.880
Let go of him!

00:10:09.460 --> 00:10:11.540
Let go of Takamine-kun!

00:10:12.300 --> 00:10:13.550
Mizuno?!

00:10:13.710 --> 00:10:17.720
Mizuno! You came! 
I'm really glad you came!

00:10:18.090 --> 00:10:19.680
I'm happy!

00:10:23.760 --> 00:10:25.390
I have a favor to ask of you.

00:10:25.390 --> 00:10:28.350
You know the kid who left
in a wheelchair just now?

00:10:29.940 --> 00:10:33.020
He's going to burn a very
important book of mine!

00:10:33.360 --> 00:10:35.230
Take that book back for me!

00:10:35.740 --> 00:10:38.240
I'm begging you, Mizuno!

00:10:43.530 --> 00:10:45.660
Leave it to me, Takamine-kun!

00:10:46.000 --> 00:10:48.410
I'll definitely get your book back!

00:10:49.710 --> 00:10:51.420
It's a good thing I came, isn't it?

00:10:51.420 --> 00:10:54.250
It's a good thing I came!

00:10:55.670 --> 00:10:57.300
I'll do my best!

00:10:57.300 --> 00:10:59.590
See you later, Takamine-kun!

00:11:02.720 --> 00:11:04.470
I'm sorry, nurse!

00:11:06.060 --> 00:11:08.020
Move it, grandma!

00:11:09.270 --> 00:11:10.770
Gash! You go, too!

00:11:10.770 --> 00:11:12.400
I'll take care of things here!

00:11:16.900 --> 00:11:18.530
Where did that guy go?

00:11:18.530 --> 00:11:20.570
I can't see his shadow or figure...

00:11:21.110 --> 00:11:22.110
I'm going, too!

00:11:22.110 --> 00:11:23.820
I won't let you run away!

00:11:24.280 --> 00:11:25.580
Let me go!

00:11:25.580 --> 00:11:27.160
Listen to what I have to say.

00:11:27.160 --> 00:11:31.290
We'd like your cooperation
with Yuuta-kun.

00:11:32.420 --> 00:11:36.630
Just now, you told him that he
would never get better, right?

00:11:38.170 --> 00:11:41.840
That kid needs some encouragement.

00:11:41.840 --> 00:11:43.260
Why me?

00:11:44.180 --> 00:11:49.560
That boy was supposed to recover in three months,
but he's been here for almost half a year now.

00:11:50.980 --> 00:11:53.730
It's just that he heals slowly.

00:11:55.860 --> 00:12:01.700
You don't realize it, but for
him, it's a serious problem.

00:12:03.450 --> 00:12:06.830
Okay... but first, the book...

00:12:06.950 --> 00:12:11.830
Damn it! Why?
Why won't my leg heal?!

00:12:13.290 --> 00:12:16.000
I will burn that book!

00:12:24.010 --> 00:12:24.050
{Part B}

00:12:32.690 --> 00:12:35.350
Let me go!

00:12:49.660 --> 00:12:54.040
Wait, damn kid! How dare you!

00:13:07.390 --> 00:13:08.720
What's wrong?

00:13:08.720 --> 00:13:11.270
Mommy's gone!

00:13:13.020 --> 00:13:16.190
Okay! Big sister will
help you look for her!

00:13:16.190 --> 00:13:17.190
Really?

00:13:17.190 --> 00:13:18.110
Right! Let's go.

00:13:21.070 --> 00:13:24.530
That kid heals slower
than normal, you say?

00:13:24.530 --> 00:13:26.610
Right. So that's why...

00:13:26.910 --> 00:13:32.330
So that's why the kid has to eat his food!

00:13:35.500 --> 00:13:37.330
Hey! Wait!

00:13:37.330 --> 00:13:38.580
No way!

00:13:39.590 --> 00:13:42.710
So, he just naturally heals slowly.

00:13:46.180 --> 00:13:49.010
I wonder if I said too much.

00:13:51.010 --> 00:13:54.140
Okay! I'll just use these to get there.

00:14:04.240 --> 00:14:06.320
I found you, Yuuta.

00:14:10.120 --> 00:14:12.660
Crap! Just a little further!

00:14:14.910 --> 00:14:16.210
That's it!

00:14:16.210 --> 00:14:19.790
W-Wait! The book disappeared!

00:14:20.330 --> 00:14:21.540
What?

00:14:21.540 --> 00:14:24.130
It disappeared from the place I left it at!

00:14:24.130 --> 00:14:25.130
What?!

00:14:25.130 --> 00:14:28.300
I'll look this way, and
you look that way, okay?

00:14:28.300 --> 00:14:29.720
Sure! Got it!

00:14:31.850 --> 00:14:32.850
Idiot.

00:14:32.850 --> 00:14:34.770
This is my chance to get the book.

00:14:34.770 --> 00:14:36.640
It's no good!

00:14:37.140 --> 00:14:38.810
We'll search for it together!

00:14:39.690 --> 00:14:42.730
No, I don't plan on
burning the book anymore,

00:14:42.730 --> 00:14:44.610
so searching separately is...

00:14:44.610 --> 00:14:46.150
What are you talking about?!

00:14:46.150 --> 00:14:49.860
Searching by yourself is reckless!
What if you get hurt? What will you do?!

00:14:50.160 --> 00:14:53.780
If you break your leg
again, what will you do?!

00:14:54.200 --> 00:14:56.750
Your leg is getting better!

00:14:58.960 --> 00:15:03.090
Since you're not planning on burning
the book, you're not an enemy!

00:15:03.090 --> 00:15:04.500
You're a friend!

00:15:04.960 --> 00:15:06.460
A friend?

00:15:06.460 --> 00:15:09.590
Right! So, let's start searching!
Where should we start?

00:15:10.130 --> 00:15:11.430
I'm sorry.

00:15:15.720 --> 00:15:16.720
That way.

00:15:16.720 --> 00:15:18.520
Okay! That way it is!

00:15:21.600 --> 00:15:25.730
It's okay! I've already
walked all over this hospital!

00:15:27.070 --> 00:15:28.610
It's not in here either...

00:15:31.030 --> 00:15:41.040
Line Room

00:15:31.990 --> 00:15:36.830
When I went to get a drink,
I didn't take very long.

00:15:36.830 --> 00:15:39.750
So, he couldn't have gone far to hide it...

00:15:41.290 --> 00:15:43.170
The only thing above us is...

00:15:43.670 --> 00:15:45.090
...the roof?

00:15:47.090 --> 00:15:51.550
Yuuta! Can I open my eyes yet?

00:15:51.800 --> 00:15:53.090
Yeah!

00:15:56.060 --> 00:15:57.100
Here you go!

00:15:59.020 --> 00:16:00.560
Hey! It's the book!

00:16:01.140 --> 00:16:03.810
Yuuta!
What are you doing up there?!

00:16:05.110 --> 00:16:08.530
I got up here with these crutches.

00:16:08.530 --> 00:16:10.400
No! That's dangerous!

00:16:10.400 --> 00:16:13.320
If you fall down and get hurt, what
do you think would happen then?!

00:16:13.320 --> 00:16:16.160
What if something happened to your leg,
just when it's finally starting to heal?!

00:16:17.740 --> 00:16:22.830
Gash, you think my leg
is really going to heal?

00:16:24.210 --> 00:16:25.670
Of course!

00:16:25.670 --> 00:16:34.760
But everybody else who's
hospitalized heals faster than I do!

00:16:35.180 --> 00:16:39.520
I'm the only one that gets
stuck in the hospital forever!

00:16:40.560 --> 00:16:41.980
Even so, you'll get better!

00:16:46.190 --> 00:16:50.110
It's okay. No matter how
much you say that...

00:16:52.530 --> 00:16:54.530
No way! You'll get better!

00:16:55.990 --> 00:16:57.280
Kiyomaro!

00:16:57.740 --> 00:17:01.290
I've never heard of a broken
bone that didn't heal!

00:17:01.660 --> 00:17:07.040
And even if there was such a
thing, I'd still keep saying it!

00:17:07.460 --> 00:17:10.840
You'll be able to walk again!

00:17:10.840 --> 00:17:11.840
Yeah!

00:17:12.300 --> 00:17:14.680
But before, you...

00:17:17.090 --> 00:17:19.810
Umm, what I said before was a lie.

00:17:20.350 --> 00:17:22.640
All that stuff I said was wrong.

00:17:24.480 --> 00:17:27.350
Yeah. Let's also make
sure to eat together!

00:17:28.310 --> 00:17:32.190
If you eat properly, you'll be able
to shoot lightning from your mouth!

00:17:33.030 --> 00:17:34.400
You idiot!

00:17:37.910 --> 00:17:40.490
There's no way you can do that!

00:17:46.790 --> 00:17:49.960
Yuuta! Don't move from there!
I'll come up to get you!

00:17:49.960 --> 00:17:53.300
It's okay! Don't get so worried!

00:17:53.710 --> 00:17:55.260
I'll get down by myself!

00:18:01.640 --> 00:18:03.140
Yuuta!

00:18:06.350 --> 00:18:07.480
Kiyomaro!

00:18:07.480 --> 00:18:08.650
I know!

00:18:11.440 --> 00:18:13.650
But... what should I do?

00:18:15.780 --> 00:18:17.360
Concrete is below him, so...

00:18:18.160 --> 00:18:20.120
if he crashes, he'll definitely...

00:18:20.570 --> 00:18:22.240
If I fall down like this...

00:18:22.240 --> 00:18:23.450
Now, it'll be twice...

00:18:23.040 --> 00:18:23.950
{}

00:18:24.950 --> 00:18:26.370
No!

00:18:29.210 --> 00:18:31.090
But wait, that's where...

00:18:32.290 --> 00:18:33.880
There's no time to hesitate!

00:18:34.510 --> 00:18:37.050
Gash! Look in Yuuta's direction!

00:18:37.800 --> 00:18:39.680
What are you planning to do, Kiyomaro?

00:18:39.680 --> 00:18:41.430
Aren't you going to save Yuuta?

00:18:42.300 --> 00:18:44.680
No!

00:18:44.890 --> 00:18:46.680
Zakeru!

00:18:58.860 --> 00:19:00.200
Yuuta?!

00:19:00.860 --> 00:19:02.070
Yuuta...

00:19:02.870 --> 00:19:05.370
Kiyomaro!
Why did you do that?!

00:19:06.370 --> 00:19:07.870
Kiyomaro!

00:19:08.500 --> 00:19:10.210
Hey, take a look.

00:19:11.960 --> 00:19:13.460
This is...

00:19:13.460 --> 00:19:16.260
It's a good thing the linen room
was right below us, eh?

00:19:20.260 --> 00:19:21.260
Kiyomaro!

00:19:23.850 --> 00:19:26.520
Honestly, getting me so excited...

00:19:27.060 --> 00:19:29.640
You... saved me...

00:19:34.060 --> 00:19:36.980
- Big sister! Bye bye!
- Thank you!

00:19:37.230 --> 00:19:38.280
See you!

00:19:42.410 --> 00:19:45.990
How do I get back to
Takamine-kun's room?

00:19:48.160 --> 00:19:52.880
Eh? It looks like
Yuuta-kun is eating again!

00:19:53.540 --> 00:19:56.040
You really encouraged him, didn't you?

00:19:56.710 --> 00:20:00.090
Maybe, but I don't think
that's the only thing...

00:20:02.470 --> 00:20:07.810
Gash! It's really because you eat your food
that you were able to shoot lightning, right?

00:20:08.270 --> 00:20:10.180
Yes! Of course!

00:20:10.640 --> 00:20:15.060
Kiyomaro, if that's a lie,
I'm holding you responsible!

00:20:15.060 --> 00:20:17.940
Well! It looks like I have two
more days until I'm out of here.

00:20:18.030 --> 00:20:19.780
Might as well take it easy for now...

00:20:21.070 --> 00:20:23.860
But I feel like I'm forgetting something...

00:20:26.780 --> 00:20:28.160
Ah, whatever!

00:20:32.710 --> 00:20:34.710
General Recepcionist

00:20:33.540 --> 00:20:34.580
Umm...

00:20:34.710 --> 00:20:34.830
General Recepcionist

00:20:34.830 --> 00:20:34.960
General Recepcionist

00:20:34.960 --> 00:20:35.080
General Recepcionist

00:20:36.790 --> 00:20:38.090
Yes?

00:20:38.300 --> 00:20:40.050
Excuse me...

00:20:40.050 --> 00:20:43.720
Patient Takamine Kiyomaro-kun's room is...

00:20:44.220 --> 00:20:47.810
This is already the fiftieth time, right?

00:20:48.760 --> 00:20:50.890
Would you like me to...

00:20:51.180 --> 00:20:52.430
Please...

00:20:57.980 --> 00:21:00.820
Takamine-kun!

00:21:01.440 --> 00:21:04.070
Now, now, it's just a little further.

00:21:05.110 --> 00:21:05.160
{Ending}

00:21:16.290 --> 00:21:20.880
ne konna koto tsuzukete itemo

00:21:16.290 --> 00:21:20.880
You know, even if we continue to progress like this

00:21:21.420 --> 00:21:26.090
shiawase wa mitsukaru no kana?

00:21:21.420 --> 00:21:26.090
Will we be able to find true happiness?

00:21:26.720 --> 00:21:31.180
tarinai mono kazoete mitemo

00:21:26.720 --> 00:21:31.180
When I try counting what is missing in my life

00:21:31.930 --> 00:21:36.350
kiri ga nai no wakatteru you

00:21:31.930 --> 00:21:36.350
I know the list will keep going on and on

00:21:36.850 --> 00:21:42.030
shinario douri nante

00:21:36.850 --> 00:21:42.030
Everything goes according to plans

00:21:42.320 --> 00:21:46.740
umaku iku wake nai kara

00:21:42.320 --> 00:21:46.740
Of course that can never happen

00:21:47.160 --> 00:21:49.410
toki ni wa zenbu

00:21:47.160 --> 00:21:49.410
At times, everything that I have

00:21:49.740 --> 00:21:52.240
nagedashi taku naru

00:21:49.740 --> 00:21:52.240
I just want to let it all go

00:21:52.700 --> 00:21:58.040
sonna hi ga attemo iiyone

00:21:52.700 --> 00:21:58.040
Is it uncommon to have days like this?

00:22:00.670 --> 00:22:05.590
hito wa mina okubyou dakara

00:22:00.670 --> 00:22:05.590
Everyone is afraid, even though we don't show it

00:22:05.800 --> 00:22:10.100
yume wo miru no kana?

00:22:05.800 --> 00:22:10.100
Is that why we dream?

00:22:11.010 --> 00:22:15.930
hito wa mina kodoku dakara

00:22:11.010 --> 00:22:15.930
Everyone feels lonely on the inside

00:22:16.180 --> 00:22:20.480
ai wo sagasu no kana?

00:22:16.180 --> 00:22:20.480
Is that why we look for love?

00:22:20.940 --> 00:22:23.480
kitto chigau

00:22:20.940 --> 00:22:23.480
Even though you are not here

00:22:23.610 --> 00:22:25.900
basho de kimi mo

00:22:23.610 --> 00:22:25.900
know that where ever you are

00:22:26.360 --> 00:22:28.070
onaji tsuki wo

00:22:26.360 --> 00:22:28.070
You are gazing up

00:22:28.280 --> 00:22:31.740
miteru you ne...

00:22:28.280 --> 00:22:31.740
at the same moon as me...

00:22:35.120 --> 00:22:35.160
{Preview}

00:22:38.210 --> 00:22:41.460
Kiyomaro! The botanical garden
is a fun place, isn't it?

00:22:41.460 --> 00:22:43.750
Hey! Don't frolic around too much, Gash!

00:22:43.750 --> 00:22:46.630
Kiyomaro! That's a
plant-controlling demon!

00:22:46.630 --> 00:22:49.380
Getting tangled up with
these people is annoying!

00:22:49.380 --> 00:22:51.760
Let's show them our combination play!

00:22:51.760 --> 00:22:54.060
Kiyomaro!
The "Zakeru" didn't appear?!

00:22:54.060 --> 00:22:55.850
What? What hurts?

00:22:55.850 --> 00:22:59.520
Next time on Konjiki no Gash Bell:
Botanical Garden Duel!

00:22:59.520 --> 00:23:02.150
Ready?! Hit that moving target!

00:23:02.150 --> 00:23:05.110
Botanical Garden Duel
